":null,"text":"我梦到的故事里，有能操纵流星的小王子，还有寻找自由的芭蕾舞者……","hasText":true,"duration":8.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/061336979C9EA1000183833313338353537.mp3"},{"id":"060406979C9E91000183134333337353036","heroId":"250","skinId":"1691","skinName":"奇遇梦乡","title":"移动喊话4","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"偶尔，我也会把梦里的经历谱成摇篮曲。","hasText":true,"duration":4.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/060406979C9E91000183134333337353036.mp3"},{"id":"065976979C9E91000183239323335353038","heroId":"250","skinId":"1691","skinName":"奇遇梦乡","title":"移动喊话2","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"老套的反派与主角，连我的小兔子都不爱听。","hasText":true,"duration":5.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/065976979C9E91000183239323335353038.mp3"},{"id":"062026979C9E91000183436303133323533","heroId":"250","skinId":"1691","skinName":"奇遇梦乡","title":"移动喊话5","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"兔兔灯已经点亮，现在是睡前故事时间！","hasText":true,"duration":6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/062026979C9E91000183436303133323533.mp3"},{"id":"066076979C9EA1000183136343232373935","heroId":"250","skinId":"1691","skinName":"奇遇梦乡","title":"移动喊话6","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"带着我们的童话，飞往每一个失眠的角落——","hasText":true,"duration":4.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/066076979C9EA1000183136343232373935.mp3"},{"id":"065316979C9E91000183135343636303737","heroId":"250","skinId":"1691","skinName":"奇遇梦乡","title":"移动喊话3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"狼外婆会收到小红帽的鲜花吗？","hasText":true,"duration":4.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/065316979C9E91000183135343636303737.mp3"},{"id":"067106979C9E81000183135383233353433","heroId":"250","skinId":"1691","skinName":"奇遇梦乡","title":"移动喊话1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"我的船每晚都会在梦境之海巡游，捞起新的灵感。","hasText":true,"duration":6.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/067106979C9E81000183135383233353433.mp3"},{"id":"069566979C9E81000183833383631343430","heroId":"250","skinId":"1691","skinName":"奇遇梦乡","title":"大厅出现2","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"不必畏惧在梦里坠落，捕梦网会接住你的全部幻想。","hasText":true,"duration":11.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/069566979C9E81000183833383631343430.mp3"},{"id":"065906979C9E71000183737353736383138","heroId":"250","skinId":"1691","skinName":"奇遇梦乡","title":"大厅出现1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"欢迎来到我的童话世界，想听什么故事?","hasText":true,"duration":14.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/065906979C9E71000183737353736383138.mp3"},{"id":"065236979C9E81000183132393533383932","heroId":"250","skinId":"1691","skinName":"奇遇梦乡","title":"大厅出现3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"不困的话，就来听动物朋友的睡前童话吧！","hasText":true,"duration":14.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/065236979C9E81000183132393533383932.mp3"},{"id":"066266929527E1000183132383235333330","heroId":"250","skinId":"466","skinName":"天籁弦音","title":"蔡文姬-拾年声藏贺文","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"我来抓人喽！\n嘿嘿~虽然，胡笳琴偶尔也会做刺客梦！\n但这并不影响我们治愈世界的步伐。\n呐~拉勾约定，我们永远是彼此的好朋友！\n未来的日子要记得：\n“左三圈，右三圈，才能简单快乐每一天~”。","hasText":true,"duration":19.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/066266929527E1000183132383235333330.mp3"},{"id":"06660648BEAE01000183136343931373233","heroId":"250","skinId":"466","skinName":"天籁弦音","title":"蔡文姬_天籁弦音_技能语音2","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"逗~~你~~玩~~~","hasText":true,"duration":2.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/06660648BEAE01000183136343931373233.mp3"},{"id":"06086648BEAE01000183633363732353330","heroId":"250","skinId":"466","skinName":"天籁弦音","title":"蔡文姬_天籁弦音_击杀语音","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"虐虐，更健康~~","hasText":true,"duration":2.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/06086648BEAE01000183633363732353330.mp3"},{"id":"06369648BEAE01000183430373732383030","heroId":"250","skinId":"466","skinName":"天籁弦音","title":"蔡文姬_天籁弦音_觉醒之战特殊语言","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"我来抓人咯","hasText":true,"duration":1.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/250/06369648BEAE0100018